{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-83b95b2cf699af89","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8001-BRANCH-A-E009\n3\ttitle: Switch trainer data cache image to a PQC base\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8001\n5\tcomponent: Training Kubeflow\n6\tteam: Training Kubeflow\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tbranch: A\n10\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8001-E002\n11\tdependencies:\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-8001-E002\n13\tgate_failure_impact:\n14\t  action: remove\n15\t  fallback_approach: If the trainer data cache uses a pure-Rust TLS stack (rustls+ring),\n16\t    a base image swap cannot remediate it; this epic is removed and the owning team\n17\t    files an OCP exception with a TLS-migration remediation plan.\n18\tai_signals:\n19\t  change_specificity: 0\n20\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n21\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n22\t  existing_foundation: 1\n23\t  open_questions: 0\n24\t  external_dependency: 0\n25\t  human_process_gates: 0\n26\t  repo_access: 1\n27\t  architecture_claims: 0\n28\timplementation_type: null\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: High\n31\tai_implementability_score: 3\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Switch trainer data cache image to a PQC base\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tConditional branch — exists only if the trainer data cache TLS stack audit confirms outcome A: the\n39\tcomponent's TLS operations route through system OpenSSL (native-tls), so a PQC base image swap\n40\tremediates it. Delivers the final runtime stage base switch for the trainer data cache image to\n41\tthe appropriate PQC base image for its current base family (per the confirmed base image mapping:\n42\t`ubi9/ubi-minimal-pqc` or `rhel9-8-els/pqc-minimal`). If the audit instead finds a pure-Rust\n43\t(rustls+ring) stack, this epic does not exist and the owning team files an OCP exception with a\n44\tTLS-migration remediation plan.\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- Final runtime stage base change for the trainer data cache image to the appropriate confirmed\n49\t  PQC base image for its base family\n50\t- No builder image changes — PQC enablement is runtime only\n51\t- Coordinate the build pipeline update for the image\n52\t- Complete the owning team's switch ticket\n53\t\n54\t## Acceptance Criteria\n55\t\n56\t- The trainer data cache image is rebuilt with its final runtime stage on the appropriate PQC base\n57\t  image for its family\n58\t- Inside the switched container, `update-crypto-policies --show` reports `DEFAULT:PQ` and\n59\t  `openssl list -kem-algorithms` lists ML-KEM-512, ML-KEM-768, and ML-KEM-1024\n60\t- Only the final runtime stage changed; builder stages are unchanged\n61\t- Build pipeline is green for the switched image\n62\t- Rollback: the image can be reverted to its prior base; PQC hybrid key exchange is negotiated\n63\t  opportunistically, so non-PQC TLS 1.3 clients continue to work via classic ECDHE\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-1 [P0]: All RHOAI runtime images must use a PQC-enabled base image — this epic delivers the\n68\t  switch for the trainer data cache image.\n69\t- HLR-3 [P0]: PQC enablement is runtime only — only the final stage of the Dockerfile/Containerfile\n70\t  changes; no builder image change is made.\n71\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bf0a326a4c4a3969","agent_id":"acc1233cc06bd6f35","session_id":"ca054b9d-00ed-4360-a728-320abe6368d2","uuid":"2a427c6b-21c8-4054-a5dd-49c34e099756","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:42:04.290Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-83b95b2cf699af89","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8001 decomposition"}
